  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance tourist information and reception at selected cultural sites in Egypt including World Heritage sites</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to lay the basis for developing a comprehensive national programme contributing to the improved accessibility and presentation of the cultural heritage sites including the World Heritage sites in Egypt. . It aims to support the preparation of a manual for the national guidelines for the site presentation and interpretation, the capacity building of site managers and stakeholders, and the design and installation of signage at the selected sites and cultural institutions. The project also supports on-site educational activities for youth.</narrative>
  </description>
